WEBVTT

00:04:31.476 --> 00:04:33.476
We have to remember,

00:04:33.516 --> 00:04:37.516
insurance is an antidote,
it's not a vaccine.

00:04:38.436 --> 00:04:40.716
It doesn’t ward off evil;

00:04:40.716 --> 00:04:43.836
it doesn't eliminate
the risks that we face.

00:04:44.556 --> 00:04:46.276
However, when it comes to insurance,

00:04:46.316 --> 00:04:49.236
the distinction between
an antidote and a vaccine

00:04:49.276 --> 00:04:53.036
somehow gets blurred in our minds.

00:04:54.436 --> 00:04:55.956
Why does it happen?

00:04:56.596 --> 00:04:59.636
It happens because people
are not that good

00:04:59.676 --> 00:05:02.436
at assessing risks rationally.